# This project's core features (skill extraction, TF-IDF matching, rule-based
# roadmap) do NOT require any API key -- they run fully offline.
#
# This file is only needed if you build the OPTIONAL "advanced" feature
# (LLM-generated resume feedback) mentioned in the assignment. Copy this
# file to ".env" and add ONE of the following if you implement that feature.
# NEVER commit your real .env file with a real key.

GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here
# or
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
# or
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
